    // ── ③ DNS · 2-FEED-DNSCRYPT LIVE DASHBOARD forwarding (dnscrypt_section.slint) — the running
    //    status + server + query feed the host pushes onto the ONE fed K5 mount (dc). `dc-live-state`
    //    rides the SAME 500 ms JNI poll that drives HOME's crown; `dc-live-queries` tails the real
    //    cache/query.log (bounded preview). These are the shell's mount only — the burger's embedded
    //    DnscryptSection stays a config surface (DNSCRYPT routes here, never there). ──
    in-out property <int> dc-live-state <=> dc.live-state;
