                    // 2-FEED-Rotation: the Rotation pillar DASHBOARD (THE ORBITAL WHEEL) mounted IN-SHELL
                    // (the rotation-dash section) — reached via ||| → PILLARS → ROTATION dashboard chip. The
                    // host feeds `rdash` field-for-field from the live `MaskSolver::rotation_snapshot()` at
                    // startup + each second while shown (the visibility-gated refresh Timer, android_main);
                    // the PILLARS rail entry (or ✕) returns. RotationPane inherits Rectangle so it embeds on
                    // the single android surface (the same law MaskSolver/Centauri/Beast/DnscryptSection follow).
                    ScrollView {
                        width: 100%;
                        height: 100%;
                        visible: root.advanced-section == "rotation-dash";
                        viewport-width: self.visible-width;
                        VerticalLayout {
                            rdash := RotationPane { }
